@LabLedger.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5143

### Register
POST {{LabLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "scientist@lab.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Ada Scientist"
}

###

# @name login
POST {{LabLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "scientist@lab.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### List samples
GET {{LabLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/samples
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get sample by id
GET {{LabLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/samples/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create sample
POST {{LabLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/samples
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Blood Sample A",
  "type": "Blood",
  "origin": "Clinic North"
}

###

### Update sample status
PATCH {{LabLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/samples/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 1
}

###

### Create test for sample
POST {{LabLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/samples/1/tests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "PCR"
}

###

### Assign test to technician
PATCH {{LabLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tests/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignedToId": 1
}

###

### Update test status
PATCH {{LabLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tests/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 1
}

###

### Record test result
POST {{LabLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tests/1/result
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": "Negative",
  "unit": "qualitative",
  "notes": "No markers detected"
}

###

### Get result
GET {{LabLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/results/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Publish result
PATCH {{LabLedger.Api_HostAddress}}/api/results/1/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
